        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A typical reason for losing the association status is when the driver was closely approaching an ACDP and decides to head for another ACDP afterwards. In this case the EV to EVSE association will be established according to the ACDP which the EV approached first. As soon as the EV leaves the PPD detection zone the association will quit. This is then a loss of association event. Then the SDP process will restart from the beginning.",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                168,
                1053,
                299
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    68.0,
                    168.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    168.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    299.0
                ],
                [
                    68.0,
                    299.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4063] For early association support the association status between EV and EVSE shall be considered as being correctly associated as long as the continuously updated PPD information provides the same EVID as received by the SDP request when the element PPD/P2PS of the SDP request was set to value \"PPD on infrastructure\" according to Table 23.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                320,
                1053,
                451
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    69.0,
                    320.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    320.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    451.0
                ],
                [
                    69.0,
                    451.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4064] For early association support the association status between EV and EVSE shall be continuously supervised by the SECC when the element PPD/P2PS of the SDP request was set to value \"PPD on infrastructure\" according to Table 23.",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                473,
                1054,
                552
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
