        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1484] After receiving a supportedAppProtocolReq, the SECC shall respond with a supportedAppProtocolRes within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215. The allowed next request shall be SessionSetupReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
