        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1486] After receiving a SessionSetupReq, the SECC shall respond with a SessionSetupRes within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 215. If the SECC is using \"PLC\", the allowed next request shall be AuthorizationSetupReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
